Postgres:

Installation:
https://postgresapp.com

Setup:
psql postgres://computer_user_name@localhost:5432/database_name
psql postgres://fedirkopakov@localhost:5432/fedirkopakov

PSQL:
======================================
\x - expanded display on/off

Connect:
psql -U database_user_name
psql -U postgres
-d, --dbname=DBNAME - database name to connect to (default: "computer_user_name")
-U, --username=USERNAME - database user name (default: "computer_user_name")

Connect to database:
psql
\c database_name

List connection data:
\conninfo

Quit psql:
\q

Go into psql:
psql




DATABASES:
======================================
List all databases:
\l
\list

Create table or run SQL inside database:
psql
\c database_name
SQL command

Work inside database:
\dt - list tables (relations)




TABLES:
======================================
List table content:
SELECT*FROM table_name; - Remember to use coma. Do not use whites space near *

Clean table:
TRUNCATE table_name

Help:
psql --help

Help for commands starting with slash \command:
psql
\help

SQL commands:
psql -c "SQL command here"
psql -c "CREATE DATABASE todos_db"

